{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instruments of Power</strong> is a tactical RPG set in a dark and crumbling fantasy world. You are a sorcerer who made a world-shaking discovery, only to lose your body and unleash an ancient evil upon the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your soul now lingers in a sanctuary beyond space and time. From there, you must reclaim the world you helped break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/f1d598316a0e1d7fd80bbdbdc46a4bbd.poster.avif?t=1774006189\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/f1d598316a0e1d7fd80bbdbdc46a4bbd.webm?t=1774006189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/f1d598316a0e1d7fd80bbdbdc46a4bbd.mp4?t=1774006189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/c59c1cb19851290ecf42638301f00e6d.avif?t=1774006189\" alt=\"Craft powerful spells\" width=1560 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/55efa1035d643a83430eee968066a2d2.poster.avif?t=1774006189\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/55efa1035d643a83430eee968066a2d2.webm?t=1774006189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/55efa1035d643a83430eee968066a2d2.mp4?t=1774006189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the catalysts, effects, and mods you discover to craft powerful custom spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape each spell carefully to counter enemy tactics, abilities, and battlefield threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/9c0a54bceb5b04f80aa9d9e139d6e72c.avif?t=1774006189\" alt=\"Summon an army of yourself\" width=1560 height=250 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/768efc735ca0302d29179cb11f7b48bb.poster.avif?t=1774006189\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/768efc735ca0302d29179cb11f7b48bb.webm?t=1774006189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/768efc735ca0302d29179cb11f7b48bb.mp4?t=1774006189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freed from the limits of the flesh, you can invoke avatars of yourself to fight the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each avatar is powerful but expendable. Every time you summon one, the tether holding your soul to this world weakens. Will you risk everything for quick victories, or fight a slower, more careful war?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/f648efc6e6949028127e7567459a8d40.avif?t=1774006189\" alt=\"Repel the shadows\" width=1560 height=250 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/e4007efddb211fc97090bd2dfce9a745.poster.avif?t=1774006189\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/e4007efddb211fc97090bd2dfce9a745.webm?t=1774006189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/e4007efddb211fc97090bd2dfce9a745.mp4?t=1774006189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reclaim lost territory through ruthless turn-based battles where positioning, timing, and careful spell use decide the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth behind the force you released, and face the consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/d0ef0aaf7e0a9df5d0cdb211f72dcc20.avif?t=1774006189\" alt=\"More details\" width=1560 height=250 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game unfolds across two layers: the sanctuary and the tactical battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the sanctuary, prepare for war. Craft spells, upgrade your catalysts, and expand your influence across the region.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When ready, choose a Site of Power to reclaim. Battles play out in turn-based tactical encounters where your avatars clash with hostile forces while activating ancient structures and artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/c931bfb646681a5ad7b674389978ee46.poster.avif?t=1774006189\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/c931bfb646681a5ad7b674389978ee46.webm?t=1774006189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/c931bfb646681a5ad7b674389978ee46.mp4?t=1774006189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/fbf62ea19b6b8cccbbaa9bb2eadbef48.avif?t=1774006189\" alt=\"Features\" width=1560 height=250 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft your own spells</strong> by combining catalysts, effects, and mods earned in battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage in deep, turn-based combat</strong> where positioning, timing, and synergy determine survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control your force:</strong> choose when, where, and how many avatars to bring into battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a <strong>diverse enemy roster\u00a0</strong>with unique abilities and distinct AI behaviors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle across hand-crafted maps</strong> featuring layered objectives and tactical challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spend Influence</strong>\u00a0from captured Sites of Power to extend your domain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your catalysts</strong> with Aether to enhance their stats and unlock powerful passive abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Confront the Entity</strong> that saved your soul and uncover the truth behind the darkness you set free.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape the ending:</strong> your choices lead to two radically different fates for the world, and yourself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/996b7c8939ce7fface9275fcc4640c9e.avif?t=1774006189\" alt=\"\"width=1560 height=263 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3791850?t=1774006189","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/133430d1379ee9fbf3c43888fbebe8c3d7cc3495/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774006189","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/638c2a22ef687e959a222dffc70160d0e9e0640e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774006189","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/638c2a22ef687e959a222dffc70160d0e9e0640e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774006189","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game features stylized but frequent combat involving magical violence. Players confront shadowy enemies in a dark world. Themes of death, identity, and moral ambiguity are explored. Some narrative elements may be unsettling."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instruments of Power</strong> is a tactical RPG set in a dark and crumbling fantasy world. You are a sorcerer who made a world-shaking discovery, only to lose your body and unleash an ancient evil upon the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your soul now lingers in a sanctuary beyond space and time. From there, you must reclaim the world you helped break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/f1d598316a0e1d7fd80bbdbdc46a4bbd.poster.avif?t=1774006189\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/f1d598316a0e1d7fd80bbdbdc46a4bbd.webm?t=1774006189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/f1d598316a0e1d7fd80bbdbdc46a4bbd.mp4?t=1774006189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/c59c1cb19851290ecf42638301f00e6d.avif?t=1774006189\" alt=\"Craft powerful spells\" width=1560 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/55efa1035d643a83430eee968066a2d2.poster.avif?t=1774006189\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/55efa1035d643a83430eee968066a2d2.webm?t=1774006189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/55efa1035d643a83430eee968066a2d2.mp4?t=1774006189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the catalysts, effects, and mods you discover to craft powerful custom spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape each spell carefully to counter enemy tactics, abilities, and battlefield threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/9c0a54bceb5b04f80aa9d9e139d6e72c.avif?t=1774006189\" alt=\"Summon an army of yourself\" width=1560 height=250 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span cla