m lost territory through ruthless turn-based battles where positioning, timing, and careful spell use decide the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth behind the force you released, and face the consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/d0ef0aaf7e0a9df5d0cdb211f72dcc20.avif?t=1774006189\" alt=\"More details\" width=1560 height=250 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game unfolds across two layers: the sanctuary and the tactical battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the sanctuary, prepare for war. Craft spells, upgrade your catalysts, and expand your influence across the region.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When ready, choose a Site of Power to reclaim. Battles play out in turn-based tactical encounters where your avatars clash with hostile forces while activating ancient structures and artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/c931bfb646681a5ad7b674389978ee46.poster.avif?t=1774006189\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/c931bfb646681a5ad7b674389978ee46.webm?t=1774006189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/c931bfb646681a5ad7b674389978ee46.mp4?t=1774006189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/fbf62ea19b6b8cccbbaa9bb2eadbef48.avif?t=1774006189\" alt=\"Features\" width=1560 height=250 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft your own spells</strong> by combining catalysts, effects, and mods earned in battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage in deep, turn-based combat</strong> where positioning, timing, and synergy determine survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control your force:</strong> choose when, where, and how many avatars to bring into battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a <strong>diverse enemy roster\u00a0</strong>with unique abilities and distinct AI behaviors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle across hand-crafted maps</strong> featuring layered objectives and tactical challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spend Influence</strong>\u00a0from captured Sites of Power to extend your domain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your catalysts</strong> with Aether to enhance their stats and unlock powerful passive abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Confront the Entity</strong> that saved your soul and uncover the truth behind the darkness you set free.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape the ending:</strong> your choices lead to two radically different fates for the world, and yourself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/extras/996b7c8939ce7fface9275fcc4640c9e.avif?t=1774006189\" alt=\"\"width=1560 height=263 /></span></p>","developers":["Iron Loop Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791850/139b96db9284d575c13ea012ecf3e984005c61dd/header.jpg?t=1774006189","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><stro